  WrittenDialogue: "Oh my, Nicole! Fancy seeing you here.\nWhy do you need to talk like that?\nTalk like what? A dialect free of any slang or pitiful ignorance?\nYou sound like an 1800’s concierge who’s gay but hasn’t discovered homosexuality yet.\nHey! I am not... {1}That, I like girls!\nYou like girls that’re 2 dimensional and can’t fuck you instead of girls that’re 3 dimensional and won’t fuck you.\nGrrr, that’s it!\nWhat’s it?\nRather than stooping to your level of insults I think it’s better I’d best you in a true ring of wit!\nOh my god.\nThat’s right, the puzzle showdown!\nYou think beating me in a puzzle is gonna make you not a perpetual virgin?\nTalk all you want cause talk is cheap! At the end of the day if I beat you it means I’m better.\n...Better at what?\nLife and intelligence!\nNo you’re only better at a stupid fucking baby puzzle game, you think you can pay bills and get bitches with this shit?\nWha-... You’re just afraid I’ll beat you!\nOkay Jeffery, let’s play then.\nFine. It’s time to show down!{0.8}\nThis isn’t a cartoon, there’s no like fate of the world here.\nYeah we’ll see!{1}"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "JEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY\nNICOLE\nJEFFERY"
